To mitigate this vulnerability, you can restrict database access and schema object-creation privileges, especially around protected types. To do so, use the following procedure as appropriate for your environment:

To discover PostgreSQL pod and labels, use the following command syntax:

kubectl get pods,svc -A --show-labels | grep -Ei 'postgres|pgsql'

